line	<str>Make your way to the Carnillean Mansion and speak to the guard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the stairs and speak to the guard again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Inspect Ceril's corpse and the broken window.</str>
line	
line	<str>Knock on the false wall, then climb up the ladder and inspect the chest in the hidden room up the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the guard again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the Fight Arena Bar, and speak to the Khazard Barman.</str>
line	
line	<str>Track down Evelot by inspecting the following during each track revealed:</str>
line	
line	<str>Approach Evelot to begin the fight. Every few attacks, she will use a special attack that disables protection prayers and drains your prayer.</str>
line	
line	<str>Finish the conversation with Evelot after defeating her.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the Hazeel Cult's hideout by way of the entrance to the Ardougne Sewers slightly east of the Clock Tower. Board the raft.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Alomone (if you sided with Hazeel) or Clivet if you didn't .</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Hazeel.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Carnillean Mansion and talk to the guard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the ladder inside the house and talk to Claus the Chef.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the south-western cooking shelves and press the button.</str>
line	
line	<str>Inspect the wall next to the noticeboard and enter the passage.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick the lock on the chest by moving the pins along to specific positions. They will appear blue if the number is correct but in the wrong position, and green if that pin is at the correct position. The ordering does not change attempt to attempt.</str>
line	
line	<str>Inspect the dusty scroll.</str>
line	
line	<str>Bring the dusty scroll to Hazeel.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the northern entrance of Weiss and speak to Big Fish.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the main building and speak to Snowflake. (Chat option 2 if you don't have the Weiss fire notes)</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the northern entrance of Weiss and speak to Big Fish.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Head down the stairs in the main building, and go through the southern cave entrance.</col>
